+# Corpus fetching
+
+The corpus fetch respected Svipall's per-domain rate limit of **12 visits per
+60-second window**. Breaching that limit imposed a **900-second (15-minute)
+cooldown** for the affected domain.
+
+Files were fetched through these hosts:
+
+- `raw.githubusercontent.com`
+- `cdn.jsdelivr.net`, using GitHub paths of the form
+  `cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/owner/repo@branch/path`
+- `cdn.statically.io` (this fallback was slow and sometimes timed out)
+
+These are the limits and hosts observed during the project corpus fetch, not
+general limits claimed for GitHub or the CDN services.
